Puranas | is_a=text | part_of=Hindu mythology | means=collections of myth, genealogy and cosmology
Brahma | is_a=figure in Hindu tradition | involves=creation in the trinity of the tradition
Vishnu | is_a=figure in Hindu tradition | involves=preservation | involves=the avatars
Shiva | is_a=figure in Hindu tradition | involves=destruction and renewal | involves=the dance of Nataraja
Ganesha | is_a=figure in Hindu tradition | involves=the removal of obstacles | has_property=depicted with an elephant's head
Hanuman | is_a=figure in the Ramayana | involves=devotion and great strength
Rama | is_a=figure in the Ramayana | involves=exile | involves=the recovery of Sita
Sita | is_a=figure in the Ramayana | involves=abduction by Ravana
Ravana | is_a=figure in the Ramayana | located_in=Lanka in the story | involves=the abduction of Sita
Krishna | is_a=figure in the Mahabharata | involves=the counsel given in the Bhagavad Gita
Arjuna | is_a=figure in the Mahabharata | involves=archery | involves=the dialogue of the Bhagavad Gita
Kurukshetra war | is_a=element of a story | part_of=Mahabharata | means=the war the epic is built around
Pandavas | is_a=group in the Mahabharata | means=the five brothers the epic follows
Kauravas | is_a=group in the Mahabharata | means=the cousins the Pandavas contend with
Panchatantra | is_a=collection of stories | located_in=India | means=animal fables gathered to teach statecraft and prudence
Jataka tales | is_a=collection of stories | located_in=India | means=stories of the Buddha's previous lives
Chinese mythology | is_a=mythology | located_in=China | involves=dragons | involves=the ordering of heaven and earth
Chinese dragon | is_a=creature in mythology | located_in=China | has_property=associated with water and good fortune rather than with menace
Monkey King | is_a=figure in Chinese literature | involves=a journey to fetch scriptures | has_property=known for mischief and transformation
Japanese mythology | is_a=mythology | located_in=Japan | involves=kami | involves=the origin of the islands
Amaterasu | is_a=figure in Japanese mythology | involves=the Sun
yokai | is_a=creature in mythology | located_in=Japan | means=a supernatural being of Japanese folklore

# --- creatures and motifs that travel ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ #
dragon | is_a=creature in mythology | has_property=a large serpent or reptile, often winged | has_property=a hoarder and a menace in Europe, a bringer of rain in East Asia
phoenix | is_a=creature in mythology | has_property=burns and is reborn from its own ashes | causes=a byword for renewal after ruin
unicorn | is_a=creature in mythology | has_property=a horse with a single horn | has_property=a symbol of purity in European tradition
mermaid | is_a=creature in mythology | has_property=a woman above and a fish below | located_in=coastal folklore across the world
giant | is_a=creature in mythology | has_property=of vastly greater than human size
ghost | is_a=figure in folklore | means=the appearance of a person who has died
vampire | is_a=creature in folklore | located_in=Eastern Europe | has_property=said to feed on the living
werewolf | is_a=creature in folklore | has_property=a person who becomes a wolf
troll | is_a=creature in folklore | located_in=Scandinavia
griffin | is_a=creature in mythology | has_property=the body of a lion and the head and wings of an eagle
centaur | is_a=creature in Greek mythology | has_property=human above and horse below
Anansi | is_a=figure in folklore | located_in=West Africa | involves=a spider who wins by wit
trickster | is_a=role in a story | means=a figure who upsets the order by cleverness rather than force | has_kind=Loki | has_kind=Anansi | has_property=found in nearly every tradition
Aesop | is_a=storyteller | located_in=Ancient Greece | involves=fables with animals and morals
Arabian Nights | is_a=collection of stories | means=a frame story enclosing many tales | involves=Scheherazade | involves=Aladdin | involves=Sinbad
Scheherazade | is_a=figure in a story | part_of=Arabian Nights | involves=telling a story each night to stay alive
King Arthur | is_a=legend | located_in=Britain | involves=the Round Table | involves=Excalibur
Excalibur | is_a=object in a myth | part_of=King Arthur | means=the sword of the legend
Robin Hood | is_a=legend | located_in=England | involves=taking from the rich to give to the poor
Atlantis | is_a=legend | means=an island civilisation said to have sunk beneath the sea | has_property=first appears in Plato as an illustration
Gilgamesh | is_a=epic poem | located_in=Mesopotamia | has_property=among the oldest surviving works of literature | involves=a search for immortality
